    {
      "id": "d5book-sticky",
      "name": "D5-WF2c-book Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        60,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## D5-WF2c-book — bookAppointment Tool Handler\n\nCalled **synchronously** by D5-WF2b. Must respond within 5 seconds.\n\n**Writes:** Appointment Log (Booked By=d5-reactivation) | Clients (Status=booked, Last Channel=voice) | Reactivation Log (status=booked)\n\n**Composite key rule:** Reactivation Log always matched on [Phone + Campaign ID].\n**Duplicate guard:** Reads Appointment Log for Phone+Status=confirmed before booking — blocks cross-channel duplicates (catches D2 and D3 bookings too).\n\n**Input:** { toolCallId, toolArgs: { date, time, service, address }, phone, campaignId, name }\n**Output:** { results: [{ toolCallId, result }] }",
        "color": 4,
        "width": 660,
        "height": 240
      }
    },
